</th>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">For mFRR Standard product (MARI) energy bids=
 can be provided and activated with Scheduled Activation or Direct Activati=
on. In this delivery the Scheduled Activations are provided per market Part=
y (BSP) per ISP.</td>
